### On-Page SEO with Fastify

For server-rendered pages or dynamically generated content, Fastify can inject SEO-friendly meta tags. [Helmet](https://helmetjs.github.io/) (already registered) helps with security headers; dynamic meta tags are typically rendered directly in your HTML response.

```tsx
