DigitalOcean [https://www.digitalocean.com/](https://www.digitalocean.com/) provides a developer-friendly cloud infrastructure, making it an excellent choice for deploying AdonisJS applications. A Droplet (their virtual private server) combined with a managed PostgreSQL database offers a cost-effective, performant, and easily scalable hosting environment.

